  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COP28 Water Pavilion</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to setting up and running of the Water Pavilion which will provide space to build partnerships and drive collective action and to train and build capacity in water governance as part of the new programme. This will enable us to do the following:  
1.	Workshops to feedback on progress and share experiences of the Water Tracker, Fairwater Footprint and water investment work with existing partners, especially governments, sharing experiences.
2.	Sessions specifically to grow those partnerships by attracting in new companies, organisations and countries as well as new donor partners and sectors such as mining and textiles.  
3.	Working meetings on aspects of the business case such as country-based delivery plans
4.	Raise awareness of the water dependencies of mitigation</narrative>
  </description>
